				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Wind): Add comprehensive architecture diagram\n\nSupplement the `Architecture.md` documentation with a detailed Mermaid graph illustrating the Wind Frontend Service Layer structure.\n\nThe diagram visualizes the `Preload.ts` shim, the categorized Effect services (Core, Editor, File System, UI, Misc), and the Layer composition strategy (`TauriLiveLayer`, `ElectronLiveLayer`, `TestLayer`). It also clarifies the data flow to the Mountain backend via Tauri and consumption by the Sky UI layer.\n\nThis addition provides a clear visual reference for the architectural boundaries and component interactions within the Wind service layer.",
